2.     AI Solution. 
(a)     Definition.  "AI Solution" means any portion of the Work that Lattice makes available for use with, or for interpretation or execution by, an artificial intelligence or machine learning system, including any agent skills, prompts, instructions, rules, guidance, templates, workflows, tool or interface definitions, connectors, servers, protocol implementations, configuration files, scripts, and accompanying documentation, in each case regardless of file format or programming, scripting, markup, or data language, whether delivered in source, script, or other human-readable form, and including any successor or replacement technology performing a similar function.
